Package: local-chat
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Local Chat Team <280044855+NoTimeToSleep-Team@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/NoTimeToSleep-Team/esp32chat
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, curl, ca-certificates, whiptail
Suggests: hostapd, dnsmasq, iptables-persistent, rsync
Description: self-hosted local chat server with a web portal
 Local Chat is an offline-first chat server for a private network:
 a FastAPI backend, a mobile-first web portal, moderation tools and
 an admin panel. It runs on a Raspberry Pi or any Debian/Ubuntu host.
 .
 The package installs into /opt/local-chat-server, creates an offline
 Python environment from bundled wheels and runs the local-chat-server
 systemd service. Configuration lives in config/app.env; user data in
 data/ (kept on removal).
